      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T20:21:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit/aside: out of curiosity - has anyone tried looking at making \u0027kvm\u0027 a feature as well or compiling it out (for symmetry). It would expose the structure of shared code between hypervisors vs hypervisor-specific code explicitly.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1389,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1389,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "676e61483f6d76128e25d74c63d9e87b3a779150",
